      "answer": "300 Ω",
      "correctOptionId": "300",
      "verifiedAt": "2026-11-15T07:03:25+05:30",
      "adapted": true,
      "independentSolution": "The Zener is assumed in breakdown with 10 V across it; maximum diode current is 0.5/10=0.05 A. Resistor drop is 25−10=15 V, and R≥15/0.05=300 Ω."
